CareLinksController ..> GrantConsentCommandAssembler : uses
CareLinksController ..> WithdrawConsentCommandAssembler : uses
CareLinksController ..> AcknowledgeActiveTargetsCommandAssembler : uses
CareLinksController ..> DischargePatientCommandAssembler : uses
CareLinksController ..> CareLinkResourceAssembler : uses
CareLinksController ..> TargetsReadStatusResourceAssembler : uses
CareLinksController ..> CareRelationshipActionResultAssembler : uses
CareLinksController ..> GetCareLinkByIdQuery : builds
PatientCareLinksController ..> CareLinkResourceAssembler : uses
PatientCareLinksController ..> CareRelationshipActionResultAssembler : uses
PatientCareLinksController ..> GetActiveCareLinkByPatientIdQuery : builds
PractitionerPatientsController ..> CareLinkResourceAssembler : uses
PractitionerPatientsController ..> GetCareLinksByPractitionerIdQuery : builds

IssueInvitationCommandAssembler ..> IssueInvitationResource : from
IssueInvitationCommandAssembler ..> IssueInvitationCommand : to
RedeemInvitationCommandAssembler ..> RedeemInvitationResource : from
RedeemInvitationCommandAssembler ..> RedeemInvitationCommand : to
GrantConsentCommandAssembler ..> GrantConsentResource : from
GrantConsentCommandAssembler ..> GrantConsentCommand : to
AcknowledgeActiveTargetsCommandAssembler ..> AcknowledgeActiveTargetsResource : from
AcknowledgeActiveTargetsCommandAssembler ..> AcknowledgeActiveTargetsCommand : to
DischargePatientCommandAssembler ..> DischargePatientResource : from
DischargePatientCommandAssembler ..> DischargePatientCommand : to
WithdrawConsentCommandAssembler ..> WithdrawConsentCommand : to

InvitationResourceAssembler ..> Invitation : from
InvitationResourceAssembler ..> InvitationResource : to
CareLinkResourceAssembler ..> CareLink : from
CareLinkResourceAssembler ..> CareLinkResource : to
TargetsReadStatusResourceAssembler ..> CareLink : from
TargetsReadStatusResourceAssembler ..> TargetsReadStatusResource : to

CareRelationshipActionResultAssembler ..> Result : maps
CareRelationshipActionResultAssembler ..> CareRelationshipError : maps
CareRelationshipActionResultAssembler ..> InvitationRedemptionOutcome : unwraps
CareRelationshipActionResultAssembler ..> InvitationResourceAssembler : uses
CareRelationshipActionResultAssembler ..> CareLinkResourceAssembler : uses
CareRelationshipActionResultAssembler ..> ProblemDetailsFactory : builds problem details with
CareRelationshipActionResultAssembler ..> IStringLocalizer : localizes with

ICareRelationshipContextFacade ..> CareLinkStatusItem : returns

@enduml
